  tau=0.50 Q_M=1.9005 I_alt=1.4955 eps(S)=0.0390 eps(X)=0.1741
  tau=0.75 Q_M=0.9931 I_alt=0.8716 eps(S)=0.0290 eps(X)=0.3297
  tau=1.00 Q_M=-0.0000 I_alt=-0.0000 eps(S)=0.0180 eps(X)=0.5000
CHECK PASS channel_tamper_buys_heat_with_world_information  re-test; JP-heat holds at every tau; eps(X) rises with tau to exactly 1/2 at full tamper; full tamper with equal couplings: Q_M=-1.2e-15; unequal couplings: Q_M=2.6582, eps(X)=0.500
